          <div style="display: flex; gap: 12px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #5848FA; margin-top: 4px;">
            <span>✓ Cero teoría</span> · <span>✓ Análisis real</span> · <span>✓ Sin compromiso</span>
